== Trivia ==
* It is the boss version of the {{e|Maw}}s.
* {{E|The Gate}} is the posthumous version of it.
* Despite its name, it behaves and looks more like a {{e|Horf}}, or a {{e|Psychic Horf}} than a Maw.
* Its fire attack could be a reference to ''[[Wikipedia:Mega Man|Mega Man]]'s'' leaf shield/attack.
* {{dlc|r}} The visual appearance of the Red Champion version may be a reference to the {{i|2Spooky}} item.

